    <overviewText>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": null,
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EUniphar Group is committed to operating sustainably across all dimensions of our business. Our ESG strategy focuses on reducing our environmental footprint, supporting our communities, and maintaining the highest standards of governance.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
